# Package Test Game — unit cube.
# Served at /assets/models/box.obj. `.obj` is not in the launcher's default
# MIME table, so launcher.config.json maps it explicitly; without that entry the
# launcher would serve it as application/octet-stream with
# Content-Disposition: attachment (FR-SRV-13) and the engine could not fetch it.

mtllib box.mtl
o cube
v -1 -1 -1
v  1 -1 -1
v  1  1 -1
v -1  1 -1
v -1 -1  1
v  1 -1  1
v  1  1  1
v -1  1  1
f 1 2 3 4
f 5 8 7 6
f 1 5 6 2
f 2 6 7 3
f 3 7 8 4
f 5 1 4 8
